OL,3,AZambians warned not to eat dead
OL,4,Awildlife after anthrax kills dozens of
OL,5,Aanimals
OL,6,
OL,7,FAuthorities in Zambia have warned
OL,8,Fpeople not to eat meat from wildlife
OL,9,Fafter dozens of wild animals, including
OL,10,Fhippos, elephants, buffalo and a
OL,11,Fcrocodile died following an anthrax
OL,12,Foutbreak.
OL,14,FA disaster management agency official
OL,15,Fsaid over the weekend that 12 people
OL,16,Fhad been infected with the disease
OL,17,Fafter consuming dead wildlife in the
OL,18,FMunyamadzi River area.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
