OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AZambians warned not to eat dead
OL,4,Awildlife after anthrax kills dozens of
OL,5,Aanimals
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe official urged the public not to
OL,8,Fconsume meat from animals that die
OL,9,Fnaturally or from unknown causes, while
OL,10,Furging the public to report any such
OL,11,Fcases.
OL,13,FAuthorities have also called for
OL,14,Fhunting in the affected area to be
OL,15,Fsuspended until the extent of the
OL,16,Fdisease and associated risks are
OL,17,Festablished.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
